{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ede867b5-47ba-8048-852a-e1a503885222",
  "created_at": "2026-01-12T09:51:18-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Kwame Haddad",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T09:47:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T09:47:47-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. I have an old appliance I need to get rid of, and I'd like to know how that works."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T09:47:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, an old appliance. What kind of appliance are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T09:48:02-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's a washing machine. A washing machine, yes. It stopped running a long time ago and it's been sitting in the cellar."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T09:48:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, a washer. And what's the address there, sir?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T09:48:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "134 Pelham Street. Pelham Street, up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T09:48:21-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "134 Pelham, Historic Hill. Okay, let me write that down. So for large items like a washer, you usually can't just set it out with the regular trash. It's treated as a bulk item and it's handled separately."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T09:48:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Handled separately. So I don't put it out with the barrels."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T09:48:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, not with the barrels. Is it still down in the cellar, or is it already outside?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T09:48:50-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Still in the cellar. My nephew's neighbor said he would help me carry it up, but not until I know what day it goes out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T09:49:01-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Let me pull up your pickup schedule here. Bear with me a second. [pause] The TV's on in the background on my end, sorry, it's the break room feed. Okay, I've got your route."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T09:49:16-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The break room. Well, mine is on too. A cooking competition, with the sound off. I can't hear it anyway, so I leave it on for the pictures."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T09:49:28-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. Okay, so your regular trash and recycling. With the storm that ended Saturday, two days ago, there were some delays last week and over the weekend, so things are a little shifted."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T09:49:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A little shifted. So when is the next pickup?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T09:49:46-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Next pickup for your street looks like Thursday. Thursday is the next regular one. Put your barrels out the night before or early that morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T09:49:57-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thursday. The night before or early that morning. And the washing machine, does it go out Thursday as well?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T09:50:05-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the thing, the bulk items usually need to be scheduled ahead of time. So I'd say don't put it out Thursday until you've set that up. I'll make a note to have somebody from the bulk pickup side call you back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T09:50:23-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Call me back. Yes, that would be fine. Do you need a number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T09:50:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes please, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T09:50:32-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0190."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T09:50:34-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0190. And the name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T09:50:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Haddad. Kwame Haddad. H-A-D-D-A-D."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T09:50:40-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Kwame Haddad, H-A-D-D-A-D. Washer, 134 Pelham, wants to know about bulk pickup. Got it all down. They should call you in a day or two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T09:50:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A day or two. All right. And in the meantime I leave it in the cellar."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T09:50:58-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, leave it where it is until you hear from them. Then your helper can bring it up on the right day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T09:51:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "On the right day. Good. Thank you, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T09:51:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Haddad. Have a good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T09:51:16-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
